---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Bank import
  accDescr: A stable statement for the expected account is copied under a lock. Actual Budget is backed up before import using stable transaction IDs. A verified receipt allows archiving. An uncertain write pauses the watcher for audit.
  csv["Poll for bank CSV"] --> stable{"File stable?"}
  stable -->|Wait| csv
  stable -->|Yes| account{"Expected<br/>account?"}
  account -->|No| reject["Reject"]
  account -->|Yes| lock["Lock snapshot<br/>Check SHA-256"]
  lock --> write["Back up and import<br/>Stable transaction IDs"]
  write --> audit{"Receipt and<br/>read-back OK?"}
  audit -.->|Unclear| pause["Pause for<br/>review"]
  audit -->|Verified| archive["Verify<br/>archive"]
